.TH SIGMACTL 1 "2026-06-27" "SigmaOS" "SigmaOS User Commands"

.SH NAME
sigmactl \- SigmaOS system control CLI

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sigmactl
.IR command
.RI [ subcommand ]
.RI [ options ]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sigmactl
is the unified command-line tool for managing SigmaOS.
It communicates with
.BR sigma-apid (8)
over gRPC (mTLS authenticated) or directly with individual daemons.

.SH COMMANDS

.SS health
Query system health from sigma-healthd.
.nf
$ sigmactl health                  # all subsystems
$ sigmactl health sigma-cryptfs    # specific subsystem
$ sigmactl health --watch          # live updates every 2s
.fi

.SS pkg
Package management (wraps sigma-pkg).
.nf
$ sigmactl pkg install vim
$ sigmactl pkg remove vim
$ sigmactl pkg list
$ sigmactl pkg rollback 3
$ sigmactl pkg update
.fi

.SS sysctl
Read and write kernel parameters.
.nf
$ sigmactl sysctl get kernel.sched.rt_threshold
$ sigmactl sysctl set security.aslr.enabled=1
$ sigmactl sysctl list security.*
.fi

.SS audit
Stream or query the audit log.
.nf
$ sigmactl audit stream             # live stream (Ctrl-C to stop)
$ sigmactl audit query --last 100
$ sigmactl audit query --pid 1042
$ sigmactl audit query --event pledge_violation
.fi

.SS kpatch
Live kernel patch management.
.nf
$ sigmactl kpatch list              # active patches
$ sigmactl kpatch load cve-2026-42.spatch
$ sigmactl kpatch revert sigma-kpatch-CVE-2026-42
$ sigmactl kpatch verify cve-2026-42.spatch
.fi

.SS service
Manage system services.
.nf
$ sigmactl service list
$ sigmactl service start sigma-metrics
$ sigmactl service stop sigma-telemetry
$ sigmactl service restart sigma-healthd
$ sigmactl service status sigma-watchdog
.fi

.SS theme
Manage the Zenith desktop theme.
.nf
$ sigmactl theme list
$ sigmactl theme set sigma-light
$ sigmactl theme set high-contrast
$ sigmactl theme create --name "my-dark" --accent "#ff6b6b"
$ sigmactl theme export my-dark > my-dark.sigma-theme
.fi

.SS kiosk
Manage kiosk mode.
.nf
$ sigmactl kiosk enable --app sigma-pos
$ sigmactl kiosk enable --url https://irctc.in
$ sigmactl kiosk status
$ sigmactl kiosk disable --admin-did did:sigma:admin:abc
.fi

.SS fleet
Manage sigma-fleet (multi-node deployment).
.nf
$ sigmactl fleet status
$ sigmactl fleet push-update --group retail-stores
$ sigmactl fleet deploy sigma-pos@1.5.0 --group retail-stores
.fi

.SS migrate
Data migration.
.nf
$ sigmactl migrate sources          # list supported sources
$ sigmactl migrate run tally company.xml
$ sigmactl migrate run windows /mnt/windows-drive
$ sigmactl migrate progress --job-id mig-12345
.fi

.SS search
Global search.
.nf
$ sigmactl search "GST filing"
$ sigmactl search --type file invoice
$ sigmactl search --type app accounting
.fi

.SH OPTIONS

.TP
.B \-\-json
Output results as JSON instead of human-readable text.

.TP
.B \-\-quiet
Suppress informational output; only show errors.

.TP
.BI "\-\-server " addr
Connect to sigma-apid at a non-default address (for remote management).

.SH FILES
.TP
.I /run/sigma/apid.sock
Default sigma-apid Unix socket.

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sigma-pkg (1),
.BR sigma-apid (8),
.BR sigma-healthd (8)

